<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8">
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,minimum-scale=1,initial-scale=1">
		<style type="text/css">	
			body{
				font-family:Arial, Ciutadella;
				line-height:20px;
				font-size:14px; 
				color:#666666;
			}
			td{
				font-family:Arial, Ciutadella;
				line-height:20px;
				font-size:14px;
				color:#666666;
			}
			p{
				font-family:Arial, Ciutadella;
				line-height:20px;
				font-size:14px;
				padding:0;
				margin:2px 0 2px 0;
				color:#666666;
			}
			#main-content sup{
				font-family:Arial, Ciutadella;
				font-size:11px; 
				bottom: 1ex; 
				vertical-align: 1px; 
				position: relative;
			}
			hr{ 
				display: block;
				border: 0;
				border-top: 1px solid #DADADA;
				padding: 0; 
				border-color: #DADADA;
				background-color: #DADADA;
				color: #DADADA;
			}
			#t&c sup{
				font-family:Arial, Ciutadella;
				font-size:9px; 
				bottom: 1ex; 
				vertical-align: 1px; 
				position: relative;
			}
			a{
				color: #666666 !important;
				text-decoration: underline;
				border:0;
			}
			h1{
				font-size:28px; 
				color: #161616; 
				line-height:32px;
			}
			h2{
				font-size:22px; 
				color: #161616; 
				line-height:26px;
			}
			h3{
				font-size:18px; 
				color: #161616; 
				line-height:22px;
			}
			ul{
				list-style-image: url('http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018381149/list-bullet-icon3.png');
				padding: 0px 15px 2px 25px;
				margin: 0;
			}
			ol{ 
				color:#E40000;
				padding: 0px 15px 2px 25px;
				margin: 0;
			}			
			li, li span{
				padding: 0px 0px 2px 5px;
				font-family:Arial, Ciutadella;
				line-height:20px;
				font-size:14px;
				color:#666666;	
			}
			@media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {
				body + table {
					width:480px !important;
				}
				#emailContainer {
					width:460px !important;
				}
				.templateColumnContainer{
					width:100% !important;
					display:block !important;
				}
				#bodyTable{
					width:460px !important;
				}
				ul{
					list-style-image: url('http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018381150/list-bullet-icon3m.png');
				}
			}		
		</style>
		<title>
			Qantas
		</title>
		<link href="http://www.qantas.com.au/img/icons/favicon.ico" rel="shortcut icon" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<table align="center" style="background-color:#F4F5F6; width:740px;" width="740">
			<tbody>
				<tr>
					<td>
						<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="bodyTable" style="line-height:23pt; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; font-size:10px; background-color:#F4F5F6;" width="680">
							<tbody>
								<tr style="height:60px; text-align:center;">
									<td align="center" colspan="5" style="text-align:center;">
									    <div style="font-size:1px; color:#F4F5F6; line-height:1px; opacity:0; overflow:hidden; height:20px; width:680px; display:block;"><br>   &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>
										<div style="display:block; font-size:10px; height:13px; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; text-align:center;"></div> 
										<div style="display:block; height:15px;">&nbsp;</div>
									</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td align="center" valign="top">
										<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="emailContainer" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;" width="680">
											<tbody>												
												<tr>
													<td align="center" valign="top">
														<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-image">
															<tbody>
																<tr>
																	<td align="center" colspan="1">
																		<img alt="Qantas" border="0" height="70" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2013300744/device-top.jpg" title="Qantas" width="680" />
																	</td>
																</tr>
															</tbody>
														</table>
													</td>
												</tr>
												<tr id="main-content">
													<td align="center" valign="top">
														<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" id="emailBody" style="color: #666666; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;" width="90%">
															<tbody>
																<tr>
																	<td align="left" colspan="3" valign="top">
																		&nbsp;
																	</td>
																</tr>
																<tr>
																	<td align="left" colspan="3" style="color: #666666; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;" valign="top">
																		Hi,
																	</td>
																</tr>															
																<tr>
																	<td align="left" colspan="3" style="color: #666666; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;" valign="top">
																		Please click <a style="color: #666666;" href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/benefits" target="_blank">here</a> to view Qantas Business Rewards.
																		<h3>You are the spirit of Australian business and you deserve to be rewarded</h3>
																		Thank you for your time on the phone today. We look forward to working with you and your business to drive even greater benefits when you fly with Qantas.
																		<br>																	
																		
																	</td>
																</tr>
																															
																<!-- Bulleted list starts here -->		
																<tr>
																	<td align="left" colspan="3" style="color: #666666; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;" valign="top">
																		<h3>Benefits at a glance</h3>
																		<table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0">
																			<tr>
																				<td align="left" valign="top" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">
																						<img style="margin:0; padding:0; border:none; display:block; width:30px; height:17px;" width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png" />
																					</div>
																				</td>
																				<td style="padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;"><strong>Earn Qantas Points from your first eligible flight.</strong> No minimum spend so you can enjoy your rewards sooner.</div>
																				</td>
																			</tr>
																		</table>
																		<table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0">
																			<tr>
																				<td align="left" valign="top" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">
																						<img style="margin:0; padding:0; border:none; display:block; width:30px; height:17px;" width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png"/>
																					</div>
																				</td>
																				<td style="padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;"><strong>More rewards the more you fly.</strong> With three levels of benefits, your business can enjoy more Qantas Points and access to greater savings.</div>
																				</td>
																			</tr>
																		</table>
																		<table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0">
																			<tr>
																				<td align="left" valign="top" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">
																						<img style="margin:0; padding:0; border:none; display:block; width:30px; height:17px;" width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png"/>
																					</div>
																				</td>
																				<td style="padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;"><strong>Rewards for your travellers and your business.</strong> Travellers will continue to earn Qantas Points and Status Credits, while your business earns Qantas Points too.</div>
																				</td>
																			</tr>
																		</table>
																		<table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0">
																			<tr>
																				<td align="left" valign="top" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">
																						<img style="margin:0; padding:0; border:none; display:block; width:30px; height:17px;" width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png"/>
																					</div>
																				</td>
																				<td style="padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;"><strong>New exclusive offers.</strong> 20% off Qantas Club membership for everyone in your team plus other exclusive offers.</div>
																				</td>
																			</tr>
																		</table>
																		<table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0">
																			<tr>
																				<td align="left" valign="top" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">
																						<img style="margin:0; padding:0; border:none; display:block; width:30px; height:17px;" width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png"/>
																					</div>
																				</td>
																				<td style="padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;"><strong>Rewards in the air and on the ground.</strong> Earn Qantas Points on business expenses with over 50 program partners.</div>
																				</td>
																			</tr>
																		</table>
																		<table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0">
																			<tr>
																				<td align="left" valign="top" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">
																						<img style="margin:0; padding:0; border:none; display:block; width:30px; height:17px;" width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png"/>
																					</div>
																				</td>
																				<td style="padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;"><strong>Your rewards. Your choice.</strong> Redeem your business’s Qantas Points for flights directly from your Qantas Business Rewards account or transfer Qantas Points to any Qantas Frequent Flyer account and they can be redeemed for upgrades accommodation, hotels and more.</div>
																				</td>
																			</tr>
																		</table>
																	</td>
																</tr>	
															
																<tr>
																	<td align="left" colspan="3" style="color: #666666; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;" valign="top">																	 
																		<a style="height:40px; width:135px;" href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/benefits" target="_blank"><img alt="Discover benefits" border="0" height="40" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2012225364/discover-benefits.jpg" title="Discover benefits" width="135" /></a>
																	</td>
																</tr>
																<tr>
																	<td align="left" colspan="3" style="color: #666666; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;" valign="top">																	 
																		<!--<hr noshade="noshade" style="border: 1px solid #dadada;" />-->
																		Terms and conditions apply. Visit <a style="color: #666666;" href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms" target="_blank">Qantas Business Rewards</a> for more information.<br> 
																		For further information, please do not hesitate to contact me on 13 10 85.<br><br>
																		Kind Regards,
																	</td>
																</tr>
																
																<tr>
																	<td align="left" colspan="3" style="color: #666666; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;" valign="top">
																		<!--<hr noshade="noshade" style="border: 1px solid #dadada;" />-->
																		<strong>{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}</strong><br>
																		{!User.Title}<br><br>

																		Qantas Corporate Sales<br>
																		Qantas Airways Limited<br><br>

																		A Wing, Level 4, 10 Bourke Road, Mascot NSW 2020<br>
																		P.  13 10 85 Ext 36<br>
																		E.  <a style="color: #666666;" href="mailto:corpsalesaus@qantas.com.au">corpsalesaus@qantas.com.au</a><br>
																	</td>
																</tr>
																<tr>
																	<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:10px; background-color:#FFFFFF;">
																		<a href="https://www.qantas.com" target="_blank"><img border="0" height="50" width="307" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2019333048/1710footerQantasOneworldLogo.jpg" /></a>
																	</td>		
																</tr>
																<tr>
																	<td align="left" colspan="1" valign="top" style="font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; font-size:9px;  color:#7B7B7B; line-height:13px;">
																		<span style="font-weight:bold;">Qantas Privacy Notice</span><br>
																		<span>Qantas collects information about you (including health information where necessary) to provide products and services to you, process your travel arrangements, facilitate your participation in the loyalty programs of Qantas and other organisations, conduct marketing activities and market research. If the information is not provided Qantas may not be able to provide the service requested. Qantas may disclose your personal information to its related companies, other carriers, travel service providers, organisations which provide services to Qantas, third parties acting on Qantas' behalf, various law enforcement agencies and governments around the world for security, customs and immigration purposes. Further details can be found in our Privacy Statement on qantas.com. You can gain access to the information Qantas holds about you by contacting Qantas Corporate Sales on 13 10 85.</span>
																	</td>
																</tr>
															</tbody>
														</table>
													</td>
												</tr>
												
												
